  "summary": "Tropical is an aesthetic that is based on the tropical regions of the world.",
  "description": "Tropical is an aesthetic that is based on the tropical regions of the world. The style is characterized by warm and soothing themes and colors drawn mostly from natural elements such as the sea, sky, and vegetation (plants, fruits, flowers, etc). Hues may be deep and rich or may fall on the lighter, brighter side.",
